        <mxCell id="acceptance" value="&lt;b&gt;每阶段验收门禁&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;public surface guard 必须通过&lt;br&gt;MCP tool count = 40 unless explicitly planned&lt;br&gt;CLI top-level 不变 unless explicitly planned&lt;br&gt;target HTTP = baseline + accepted overlays&lt;br&gt;/api/v1/knowledge/* retained&lt;br&gt;无上层应用生产依赖&lt;br&gt;current-vs-target-gap.md 更新后必须同步更新本 drawio&lt;br&gt;md / drawio 的阶段状态、route count、剩余计划和验收门禁必须一致" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;spacing=14;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
